Polymorphing spellbooks is indeed an excellent idea, but one by one is
a horrid waste of turns and charges. Who knowns, if Ykstort had had a
pile of 5 books, perhaps he would have gotten haste self and could
have gone without the boots. I sometimes kill the Valley priest just
