The silver scale mail, on the other hand, isn't that useful if you
spend most of your game in monster forms that cannot wear body armor.
Other solutions include movement tactics, porting around fast enough
so monsters don't get to zap you, polypiling amulets, genociding
dragons, and watching out for that occasional shield of reflection.
While inadequate for the endurance, newbie-type game Aki likely has in
mind, these strategies combined are surprisingly low-risk. Especially
compared with the other risks inherent in speed running.

