If you move fast enough, you don't need a Luck item at all. Generally,
you want Luck>=3D9 to levelport with control using confused scrolls and
Luck>=3D6 to write unknown scrolls - that means you have around 900
turns of buffer. It helps if a few unicorns end up in the Valley of
the Dead, where every speed runner has to go at least three times and
can toss them a gem in passing. I like to revgeno unicorns while
sitting inside the wall between the gem chamber and the trapdoors
because those inside the chamber are easy to hunt down, in case you
haven't formally identified your gems or are missing a horn.

